    eapply (srz_mmap_none1 SEGS scfg Halloc R (Z_to_bv 64 (pc cs)) FULL (seg_rom SEGS) model w len (Z_to_bv 64 34) TB Hf He Hhalt R17 R11 Hlen R12 R13 mmap_flags_core_22 R14 R15
